SUMMARY:Enniamera of the Virgin\, Ano Mera
LOCATION:Ano Mera\, Mykonos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Nine days after the Dormition\, Panagia Tourliani in Ano Mera has a second\, quieter panigiri in the monastery square with the local group Aposperites playing island music\, food and wine. Less crowded than the 15th and easier to get a table at the tavernas around the square.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/mykonos/#ano-mera-enniamera-of-the-virgin-ano-mera
